From: Alastair D'Silva <alastair@d-silva.org>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 14:42:58 +1000
Subject: phy: allwinner: Add Cadence Combo SerDes PHY driver for A733

Add drivers/phy/allwinner/phy-sunxi-cadence-combophy.c supporting the Cadence
Combo SerDes PHY on Allwinner A733 (sun60iw2).

On the A733 SoC, the PCIe Gen3 controller and SuperSpeed USB 3.0 controller
share a high-speed Cadence SerDes combo PHY. The PHY requires specialized analog
tuning and calibration tables depending on whether it is operating in PCIe mode
(Gen1/Gen2/Gen3 at up to 8Gbps) or USB 3.0 PIPE mode (5Gbps).

This driver manages mode selection, clock un-gating, reset deassertion, and
hardware register table programming ported from Allwinner BSP specifications,
enabling reliable physical layer link training without signal integrity errors.

Signed-off-by: Allwinner Technology Co., Ltd. <service@allwinnertech.com>
Signed-off-by: Alastair D'Silva <alastair@d-silva.org>
Assisted-by: Antigravity <antigravity@google.com>

---
diff --git a/drivers/phy/allwinner/combo0_calib_array.h b/drivers/phy/allwinner/combo0_calib_array.h
new file mode 100644
index 000000000000..127b735295c9
--- /dev/null
+++ b/drivers/phy/allwinner/combo0_calib_array.h
@@ -0,0 +1,1200 @@
